#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Code Assistant {#qiskit-code-assistant}"
msgstr "Qiskit Code Assistant {#qiskit-code-assistant}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Code Assistant LLMs aim to make quantum computing more accessible to "
"new Qiskit adopters and to improve the coding experience for current users. "
"It is trained using millions of text tokens from Qiskit SDK, years of Qiskit"
" code examples, and IBM Quantum&reg; features. Qiskit Code Assistant can "
"help your quantum development workflow by offering LLM-generated suggestions"
" based on [IBM Granite and other open-source "
"models](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit), which incorporate the latest "
"features and functionalities from IBM&reg;.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga LLM ng Qiskit Code Assistant ay layuning gawing mas madaling ma-"
"access ang quantum computing para sa mga bagong gumagamit ng Qiskit at "
"mapabuti ang karanasan sa pag-code ng mga kasalukuyang users. Ito ay sinanay"
" gamit ang milyun-milyong text token mula sa Qiskit SDK, maraming taon ng "
"mga halimbawa ng Qiskit code, at mga feature ng IBM Quantum&reg;. "
"Makakatulong ang Qiskit Code Assistant sa iyong quantum development workflow"
" sa pamamagitan ng pag-aalok ng mga mungkahi na ginawa ng LLM batay sa [IBM "
"Granite at iba pang open-source na modelo](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit) na"
" nagsasama ng mga pinakabagong feature at functionality mula sa IBM&reg;.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"- **Want to skip to the installation instructions? Go to the [Install Qiskit Code Assistant](#install) section.**\n"
"- If you have feedback or want to contact the developer team, use the [Qiskit Slack Workspace channel](https://qiskit.enterprise.slack.com/archives/C07LYA6PL83) or the related public GitHub repositories.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Mga Tala\">\n"
"- **Gusto mong diretso na pumunta sa mga tagubilin sa pag-install? Pumunta sa seksyon ng [I-install ang Qiskit Code Assistant](#install).**\n"
"- Kung mayroon kang feedback o gusto mong makipag-ugnayan sa development team, gamitin ang [Qiskit Slack Workspace channel](https://qiskit.enterprise.slack.com/archives/C07LYA6PL83) o ang mga kaugnay na pampublikong GitHub repository.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Large Language Model (LLM) behind Qiskit Code Assistant {#the-large-"
"language-model-llm-behind-qiskit-code-assistant}"
msgstr ""
"Ang Large Language Model (LLM) sa likod ng Qiskit Code Assistant {#the-"
"large-language-model-llm-behind-qiskit-code-assistant}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To provide code suggestions, Qiskit Code Assistant uses a Large Language "
"Model (LLM). In this case, Qiskit Code Assistant currently relies on the "
"model `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit`, built on the [Mistral-"
"Small-3.2-24B-Qiskit model](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit). The `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` model improves the"
" `Mistral-Small-3.2-24B-Instruct-2506` model's code generation capabilities "
"for Qiskit through extended pretraining and fine-tuning it on high-quality "
"Qiskit data, as well as Python commits and chat. For more information about "
"the Mistral AI models family, refer to [Mistral AI "
"documentation](https://docs.mistral.ai/getting-started/models). For more "
"details about the `.*-qiskit` models, see [Qiskit Code Assistant: Training "
"LLMs for generating Quantum Computing "
"Code](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.19495).\n"
msgstr ""
"Para makapagbigay ng mga mungkahi sa code, gumagamit ang Qiskit Code "
"Assistant ng Large Language Model (LLM). Sa kasong ito, kasalukuyang umaasa "
"ang Qiskit Code Assistant sa modelong `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit`, na "
"itinayo sa [Mistral-Small-3.2-24B-Qiskit "
"model](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit). Ang "
"`mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` na modelo ay nagpapabuti ng kakayahan sa code"
" generation ng modelong `Mistral-Small-3.2-24B-Instruct-2506` para sa Qiskit"
" sa pamamagitan ng extended pretraining at fine-tuning nito sa mataas na "
"kalidad na Qiskit data, gayundin ang mga Python commit at chat. Para sa "
"karagdagang impormasyon tungkol sa pamilya ng Mistral AI models, tingnan ang"
" [dokumentasyon ng Mistral AI](https://docs.mistral.ai/getting-"
"started/models). Para sa karagdagang detalye tungkol sa mga `.*-qiskit` na "
"modelo, tingnan ang [Qiskit Code Assistant: Training LLMs for generating "
"Quantum Computing Code](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.19495).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Our LLMs specialized for Qiskit are available also as open-source models. "
"Check all the models available at https://huggingface.co/Qiskit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang aming mga LLM na espesyalista para sa Qiskit ay available din bilang mga"
" open-source na modelo. Tingnan ang lahat ng available na modelo sa "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit HumanEval and Qiskit HumanEval Hard benchmarks {#the-qiskit-"
"humaneval-and-qiskit-humaneval-hard-benchmarks}"
msgstr ""
"Ang Qiskit HumanEval at Qiskit HumanEval Hard benchmarks {#the-qiskit-"
"humaneval-and-qiskit-humaneval-hard-benchmarks}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To test the `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` and other models, we collaborated"
" with Qiskit Advocates and experts to create the execution-based benchmarks "
"called Qiskit HumanEval (QHE) and Qiskit HumanEval Hard (QHE Hard), and ran "
"them on the models. These benchmarks are similar to "
"[HumanEval](https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.03374), including multiple "
"challenging code problems to solve, all based on the official Qiskit "
"libraries.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para subukan ang `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` at iba pang mga modelo, "
"nakipagtulungan kami sa mga Qiskit Advocate at eksperto para lumikha ng mga "
"execution-based na benchmark na tinatawag na Qiskit HumanEval (QHE) at "
"Qiskit HumanEval Hard (QHE Hard), at pinatakbo ang mga ito sa mga modelo. "
"Ang mga benchmark na ito ay katulad ng "
"[HumanEval](https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.03374), na kinabibilangan ng maraming"
" mapaghamong problema sa code na dapat solusyunan, lahat ay batay sa mga "
"opisyal na Qiskit library.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The benchmarks are composed of approximately 150 tests, each one made from a"
" function definition, followed by a docstring that details the task the "
"model is required to solve. Each example also includes a reference canonical"
" solution, as well as unit tests, to evaluate the correctness of the "
"generated solutions. There are three levels of difficulty for tests: basic, "
"intermediate, and difficult. The Qiskit HumanEval Hard benchmark is a "
"variation of the Qiskit HumanEval one, but removes information related to "
"code imports, so the LLM needs to figure out the right method or class "
"imports. This change makes the dataset much more challenging for LLMs, "
"according to our tests and initial results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga benchmark ay binubuo ng humigit-kumulang 150 na pagsubok, bawat isa "
"ay gawa mula sa isang function definition, na sinusundan ng isang docstring "
"na nagdedetalye ng gawain na kailangang solusyunan ng modelo. Bawat "
"halimbawa ay naglalaman din ng isang reference canonical solution, gayundin "
"ang mga unit test, para masuri ang kawastuhan ng mga nabuong solusyon. "
"Mayroong tatlong antas ng kahirapan para sa mga pagsubok: basic, "
"intermediate, at mahirap. Ang Qiskit HumanEval Hard benchmark ay isang "
"variation ng Qiskit HumanEval, ngunit inaalis ang impormasyon na may "
"kaugnayan sa mga code import, kaya kailangang alamin ng LLM ang tamang "
"method o class import. Ang pagbabagong ito ay nagpapahirap ng dataset para "
"sa mga LLM, ayon sa aming mga pagsubok at paunang resulta.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The datasets for Qiskit HumanEval and Qiskit HumanEval Hard are available at"
" these websites: [Qiskit "
"HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval) and "
"[Qiskit "
"HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval_hard). "
"You can contribute to the development of these benchmarks at the [GitHub "
"repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-human-eval).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga dataset para sa Qiskit HumanEval at Qiskit HumanEval Hard ay "
"available sa mga website na ito: [Qiskit "
"HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval) at "
"[Qiskit "
"HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval_hard). "
"Maaari kang mag-ambag sa pagpapaunlad ng mga benchmark na ito sa [GitHub "
"repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-human-eval).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"install\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"install\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit Code Assistant {#install-qiskit-code-assistant}"
msgstr "I-install ang Qiskit Code Assistant {#install-qiskit-code-assistant}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Learn how to install, configure, and use any of Qiskit Code Assistant models"
" on your local machine.\n"
msgstr ""
"Alamin kung paano mag-install, mag-configure, at gumamit ng alinman sa mga "
"modelo ng Qiskit Code Assistant sa iyong lokal na makina.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Download from the Hugging Face website\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"I-download mula sa website ng Hugging Face\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow these steps to download any Qiskit Code Assistant-related model from "
"the Hugging Face website:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sundin ang mga hakbang na ito para i-download ang anumang modelong kaugnay "
"ng Qiskit Code Assistant mula sa website ng Hugging Face:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to the desired Qiskit model page on Hugging Face.\n"
msgstr "Pumunta sa nais na pahina ng Qiskit model sa Hugging Face.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to the **Files and Versions** tab and download the safetensors or GGUF "
"model files.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pumunta sa tab na **Files and Versions** at i-download ang mga safetensors o"
" GGUF model file.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</AccordionItem>\n"
msgstr "</AccordionItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<AccordionItem title=\"Download using the Hugging Face CLI\">\n"
msgstr "<AccordionItem title=\"I-download gamit ang Hugging Face CLI\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To download any of the available Qiskit Code Assistant models using the "
"Hugging Face CLI, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Para i-download ang alinman sa mga available na modelo ng Qiskit Code "
"Assistant gamit ang Hugging Face CLI, sundin ang mga hakbang na ito:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the [Hugging Face "
"CLI](https://huggingface.co/docs/huggingface_hub/main/en/guides/cli)\n"
msgstr ""
"I-install ang [Hugging Face "
"CLI](https://huggingface.co/docs/huggingface_hub/main/en/guides/cli)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Log in to your Hugging Face account\n"
msgstr "Mag-login sa iyong Hugging Face account\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli login\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli login\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Download the model you prefer from the previous list\n"
msgstr "I-download ang modelong gusto mo mula sa nakaraang listahan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli download <HF REPO NAME> <MODEL PATH> --local-dir <LOCAL PATH>\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli download <HF REPO NAME> <MODEL PATH> --local-dir <LOCAL PATH>\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Manually deploy the Qiskit Code Assistant models in "
"local through Ollama\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Manu-manong i-deploy ang mga modelo ng Qiskit Code "
"Assistant sa lokal sa pamamagitan ng Ollama\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There are multiple ways to deploy and interact with the downloaded Qiskit "
"Code Assistant model. This guide demonstrates using "
"[Ollama](https://ollama.com) as follows: either with the [Ollama "
"application](#using-the-ollama-application) by using the Hugging Face Hub "
"integration or local model, or with the [`llama-cpp-python` package](#use-"
"llama-cpp-python).\n"
msgstr ""
"Mayroong maraming paraan para i-deploy at makipag-ugnayan sa na-download na "
"modelo ng Qiskit Code Assistant. Ipinapakita ng gabay na ito ang paggamit ng"
" [Ollama](https://ollama.com) tulad ng sumusunod: alinman sa [Ollama "
"application](#using-the-ollama-application) sa pamamagitan ng paggamit ng "
"Hugging Face Hub integration o lokal na modelo, o sa [`llama-cpp-python` "
"package](#use-llama-cpp-python).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Using the Ollama application {#using-the-ollama-application}"
msgstr "Paggamit ng Ollama application {#using-the-ollama-application}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Ollama application provides a simple solution to run the LLMs locally. "
"It is easy to use, with a CLI that makes the whole setup process, model "
"management, and interaction fairly straightforward. It’s ideal for quick "
"experimentation and for users that want fewer technical details to handle.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Ollama application ay nagbibigay ng simpleng solusyon para patakbuhin "
"ang mga LLM nang lokal. Madaling gamitin, na may CLI na ginagawang mas "
"diretso ang buong proseso ng setup, pamamahala ng modelo, at pakikipag-"
"ugnayan. Ito ay perpekto para sa mabilis na eksperimento at para sa mga user"
" na gustong mas kaunting teknikal na detalye ang hawakan.\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Ollama {#install-ollama}"
msgstr "I-install ang Ollama {#install-ollama}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Download the [Ollama application](https://ollama.com/download)\n"
msgstr "I-download ang [Ollama application](https://ollama.com/download)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install the downloaded file\n"
msgstr "I-install ang na-download na file\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Launch the installed Ollama application\n"
msgstr "Ilunsad ang na-install na Ollama application\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"info\">\n"
"        The application is running successfully when the Ollama icon appears in the desktop menu bar. You can also verify the service is running by going to `http://localhost:11434/`.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"info\">\n"
"        Matagumpay na tumatakbo ang application kapag lumitaw ang Ollama icon sa desktop menu bar. Maaari mo ring i-verify na tumatakbo ang serbisyo sa pamamagitan ng pagpunta sa `http://localhost:11434/`.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Try Ollama in your terminal and start running models. For example:\n"
msgstr ""
"Subukan ang Ollama sa iyong terminal at simulang magpatakbo ng mga modelo. "
"Halimbawa:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama run hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama run hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up Ollama using the Hugging Face Hub integration {#set-up-ollama-using-"
"the-hugging-face-hub-integration}"
msgstr ""
"I-set up ang Ollama gamit ang Hugging Face Hub integration {#set-up-ollama-"
"using-the-hugging-face-hub-integration}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [Ollama/Hugging Face Hub "
"integration](https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/ollama) provides a way to "
"interact with models hosted on the Hugging Face Hub without needing to "
"create a new modelfile nor manually downloading the GGUF or safetensors "
"files. The default `template` and `params` files are already included for "
"the model on the Hugging Face Hub.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang [Ollama/Hugging Face Hub "
"integration](https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/ollama) ay nagbibigay ng paraan"
" para makipag-ugnayan sa mga modelong naka-host sa Hugging Face Hub nang "
"hindi na kailangang lumikha ng bagong modelfile o manu-manong i-download ang"
" mga GGUF o safetensors file. Ang mga default na `template` at `params` file"
" ay kasama na para sa modelo sa Hugging Face Hub.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure the Ollama application is running.\n"
msgstr "Siguraduhing tumatakbo ang Ollama application.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go the desired model page, and copy the URL. For example, "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pumunta sa nais na pahina ng modelo, at kopyahin ang URL. Halimbawa, "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "From your terminal, run the command:\n"
msgstr "Mula sa iyong terminal, patakbuhin ang command:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use the `hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` model or any of the "
"other currently recommended GGUF official models `hf.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF` or `hf.co/Qiskit/granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari mong gamitin ang modelong `hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` o "
"alinman sa iba pang kasalukuyang inirerekomendang opisyal na GGUF model na "
"`hf.co/Qiskit/mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF` o "
"`hf.co/Qiskit/granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF`.\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up Ollama with a manually downloaded Qiskit Code Assistant GGUF model "
"{#set-up-ollama-with-a-manually-downloaded-qiskit-code-assistant-gguf-model}"
msgstr ""
"I-set up ang Ollama gamit ang manu-manong na-download na GGUF model ng "
"Qiskit Code Assistant {#set-up-ollama-with-a-manually-downloaded-qiskit-"
"code-assistant-gguf-model}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have manually downloaded a GGUF model such as "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF and you want to "
"experiment with different templates and parameters, you can follow these "
"steps to load it into your local Ollama application.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung manu-mano kang nag-download ng GGUF model tulad ng "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF at gusto mong "
"mag-eksperimento sa iba't ibang template at parameter, maaari kang sundin "
"ang mga hakbang na ito para i-load ito sa iyong lokal na Ollama "
"application.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create a `Modelfile` entering the following content and be sure to update "
"`<PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>` to the actual path of your downloaded model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lumikha ng `Modelfile` na may sumusunod na nilalaman at tiyaking i-update "
"ang `<PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>` sa aktwal na path ng iyong na-download na "
"modelo.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    FROM <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
"    TEMPLATE \"\"\"{{ if .System }}\n"
"    System:\n"
"    {{ .System }}\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    FROM <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
"    TEMPLATE \"\"\"{{ if .System }}\n"
"    System:\n"
"    {{ .System }}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    {{ end }}{{ if .Prompt }}Question:\n"
"    {{ .Prompt }}\n"
msgstr ""
"    {{ end }}{{ if .Prompt }}Question:\n"
"    {{ .Prompt }}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    {{ end }}Answer:\n"
"    ```\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"
msgstr ""
"    {{ end }}Answer:\n"
"    ```\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    PARAMETER stop \"Question:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"Answer:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"System:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"```\"\n"
msgstr ""
"    PARAMETER stop \"Question:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"Answer:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"System:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"```\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    PARAMETER temperature 0\n"
"    PARAMETER top_k 1\n"
msgstr ""
"    PARAMETER temperature 0\n"
"    PARAMETER top_k 1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "    ```\n"
msgstr "    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run the following command to create a custom model instance based on the "
"`Modelfile`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Patakbuhin ang sumusunod na command para lumikha ng custom na model instance"
" batay sa `Modelfile`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama create Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit -f ./path-to-model-file\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama create Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit -f ./path-to-model-file\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"        This process may take some time for Ollama to read the model file, initialize the model instance, and configure it according to the specifications provided.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"        Maaaring tumagal ng ilang oras ang prosesong ito para mabasa ng Ollama ang model file, ma-initialize ang model instance, at ma-configure ito ayon sa mga tinukoy na specification.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run the Qiskit Code Assistant model manually downloaded in Ollama"
msgstr ""
"Patakbuhin ang modelo ng Qiskit Code Assistant na manu-manong na-download sa"
" Ollama"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After the `Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` model has been set up in Ollama, run "
"the following command to launch the model and interact with it in the "
"terminal (in chat mode).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos ma-set up ang modelong `Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` sa Ollama, "
"patakbuhin ang sumusunod na command para ilunsad ang modelo at makipag-"
"ugnayan dito sa terminal (sa chat mode).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "from llama_cpp import Llama\n"
msgstr "from llama_cpp import Llama\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "model_path = <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
msgstr "model_path = <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"model = Llama(\n"
"        model_path,\n"
"        seed=17,\n"
"        n_ctx=10000,\n"
"        n_gpu_layers=37, # to offload in gpu, but put 0 if all in cpu\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"model = Llama(\n"
"        model_path,\n"
"        seed=17,\n"
"        n_ctx=10000,\n"
"        n_gpu_layers=37, # to offload in gpu, but put 0 if all in cpu\n"
"    )\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"input = 'Generate a quantum circuit with 2 qubits'\n"
"raw_pred = model(input)[\"choices\"][0][\"text\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"input = 'Generate a quantum circuit with 2 qubits'\n"
"raw_pred = model(input)[“choices”][0][“text”]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"generation_kwargs = {\n"
"        \"max_tokens\": 512,\n"
"        \"echo\": False, # Echo the prompt in the output\n"
"        \"top_k\": 1\n"
"    }\n"
msgstr ""
"generation_kwargs = {\n"
"        “max_tokens”: 512,\n"
"        “echo”: False, # Echo the prompt in the output\n"
"        “top_k”: 1\n"
"    }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "raw_pred = model(input, **generation_kwargs)[\"choices\"][0][\"text\"]\n"
msgstr "raw_pred = model(input, **generation_kwargs)[“choices”][0][“text”]\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use a local model file {#use-a-local-model-file}"
msgstr "Use a local model file {#use-a-local-model-file}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "llama-cli -m my_model.gguf -cnv\n"
msgstr "llama-cli -m my_model.gguf -cnv\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Or download and run a model directly from Hugging Face {#or-download-and-"
"run-a-model-directly-from-hugging-face}"
msgstr ""
"Or download and run a model directly from Hugging Face {#or-download-and-"
"run-a-model-directly-from-hugging-face}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF -cnv\n"
msgstr "llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF -cnv\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "llama-server -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF\n"
msgstr "llama-server -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF \\\n"
"  -p \"You are a friendly assistant.\" -cnv \\\n"
"  --temp 0.7 \\\n"
"  --top-k 50 \\\n"
"  --top-p 0.95 \\\n"
"  --repeat-penalty 1.1 \\\n"
"  --seed 42\n"
msgstr ""
"llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF \\\n"
"  -p “You are a friendly assistant.” -cnv \\\n"
"  --temp 0.7 \\\n"
"  --top-k 50 \\\n"
"  --top-p 0.95 \\\n"
"  --repeat-penalty 1.1 \\\n"
"  --seed 42\n"

